    oe:aboutDisease oed:schizophrenia ;
    oe:answerText "The M EMERGENT-5 (NCT04820309) was a 52-week, open-label trial evaluating the long-term safety, tolerability, and efficacy of twice daily KarXT (maximum dose 125/30 mg) in psychiatrically stable adults with schizophrenia. Safety measures included treatment-emergent adverse events (TEAEs), vital signs, and laboratory parameters."^^xsd:string ;
